      "1. SCAFFOLD: RFdiffusion-AllAtom (RFdiffusionAA) or Boltz protein-design against the target metabolite as the ligand; generate ~10^2-10^3 backbones with a pocket complementary to the DISCRIMINATING group (+25-OH (side-chain terminus)).",
      "2. SEQUENCE: LigandMPNN (ligand-aware) to design pocket sequences that H-bond the distinguishing -OH; avoid making room for the off-target groups.",
      "3. FILTER (positive): co-fold designs vs the TARGET (Boltz/AF3) \u2014 keep high interface confidence + correct pocket contact to the discriminating -OH.",
      "4. COUNTER-SELECT (negative): co-fold survivors vs EVERY off-target; KEEP only those with a large specificity margin (specificity_score) \u2014 this is the step that buys discrimination, and the one single-target design skips.",
      "5. Feed the selective binder into the biosensor pipeline (chimera -> reporter)."
